{"title":"Ornot Fog Eater: Carl’s Nemesis","link":"https://theradavist.com/ornot-fog-eater","date":1792501248000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0ef1decf6b91bfe97a570e4ce518aac0561707b9714b04075299d6df5c1f930c.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/db36dc92647566753ad20b099dc9c2c131b6f5cfe0216ba822563113b48b5499.jpg 640w, /media/0ef1decf6b91bfe97a570e4ce518aac0561707b9714b04075299d6df5c1f930c.jpg 1800w, /media/f70e1244001ba13d8e0dbe41b91584514d73ebc9c341a90fba58a9746161fedd.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em>The new <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/ornot\" target=\"_blank\">Ornot</a> Fog Eater is the San Francisco brand’s first waterproof layer. It’s designed to eat whatever Carl, San Francisco’s resident fog, throws at it. It will also work with other unnamed atmospheric events in any place where atmospheric moisture occurs. Read below for the details.</em></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f321406d9ec3311f4e70fbb02352e22fbb25d060991dd32d9a2afc498fdfeeea.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/f16ae72deb8a28d3eb12c08ce849270260c3a56deeda2dd02c27cb1f3504386e.jpg 800w, /media/796665b18377fa46eaacd45870c6d3144f2c91f8f71e0f973ccb5b0055e31012.jpg 1600w, /media/f321406d9ec3311f4e70fbb02352e22fbb25d060991dd32d9a2afc498fdfeeea.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b9dd591562140d5c8a2fa0e98c0707f638963ee9577576f8bdcb12ca848b9de5.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/df71739c8ae60c98c11adc80d8471ea94b7e9ec6593540195a7576e5e067d422.jpg 800w, /media/2c46c5ae5507d12a78ba2d58bf8ac9f167a95fa487263bf6bc4b2455771fdfa1.jpg 1600w, /media/b9dd591562140d5c8a2fa0e98c0707f638963ee9577576f8bdcb12ca848b9de5.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>Ornot Fog Eater Quick Hits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>3-point adjustable hood w/ rain peak</li>\n<li>Hem adjuster</li>\n<li>Hand warmer pockets (left pocket is a stuff sack)</li>\n<li>Internal drop pockets</li>\n<li>Zippered rear pocket</li>\n<li>Reflective details</li>\n<li>Colors:\n<ul>\n<li>Men’s: Stone Green / Citron</li>\n<li>Women’s: Citron</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>MSRP: $325 USD</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/fc10a024c77dad06196f7a64dafd5e3340295793757ab9b9078e1266e3757012.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/f99caf1ea99a747462289e2ea37bd75a61b10dfc9ab8c124edfdd1d69422ba72.jpg 800w, /media/fc10a024c77dad06196f7a64dafd5e3340295793757ab9b9078e1266e3757012.jpg 1600w, /media/8894fc4c974d6be279455fb12da461f8ef926d250b7f05c5d8493fba668f4500.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4a1e40c2468ce62aa7257cf5bc541c496e508b83c023188053ed6478bbd56241.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/aa5f5acdc66a3e512d5e0e4df9566d9e17abce96b9c4b1f6f469b9b7de7e26ab.jpg 800w, /media/4a1e40c2468ce62aa7257cf5bc541c496e508b83c023188053ed6478bbd56241.jpg 1600w, /media/bd0b664f25fe5d3fe554c3ae37c811c794eb7c6b4bc72334ad821adfef90c868.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/edfd46522605660a33b85cc613cdf1e2b1a6b3c0a895b5c1e9a2d0728d0bc67c.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5542d423e9334a39a051179cc3166c83cfff4840a3663dba5bcab0ae6ba688f7.jpg 800w, /media/edfd46522605660a33b85cc613cdf1e2b1a6b3c0a895b5c1e9a2d0728d0bc67c.jpg 1600w, /media/bb88166cf4b6b1800bacd6d317d2f0eefb82937f7596f9a738b1c48215694027.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>Fog Eater Overview</h3>\n<p>The Fog Eater is Ornot’s new waterproof rain jacket. Designed with 3L Pertex® Shield fabric, a dropped hem, and PFC-Free DWR treatment, it keeps you dry on wet rides without using forever chemicals. Pack it into its own pocket, and stuff it in your bar bag when the skies clear.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/958bae2ec00c3684e430c05c178b2902c8e2fc62673c1bc34fd9405cbd552b3d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/719d3c779f02a0fc9447cf3c41cf3020dda63792d5f066c7cf9ecc42963c11ec.jpg 800w, /media/958bae2ec00c3684e430c05c178b2902c8e2fc62673c1bc34fd9405cbd552b3d.jpg 1600w, /media/bba61c6acea846efea25a8a0fb8b707d8064b7f09c3fd314071b9accf564cc72.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/8ceb365f314ce0ccd4af6feddf52603f009d293a92269cf52b120f0ab1381054.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/d096e2c2827cdfffbfc92f0ba102d5958e7290a049443ca7ce30f39f81cecbc1.jpg 800w, /media/8ceb365f314ce0ccd4af6feddf52603f009d293a92269cf52b120f0ab1381054.jpg 1600w, /media/7aebd84990c5e86c84cd8d05b1a8d405cef017e7d82a1be7f0e5080984261bb8.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/146278c268c26fc344f0bdd3cbe05e7455bd0e53341e2d88117a0a169cf131ee.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/63fb42d990d570516131b8aab5fe6a79434391f2fcd67afdeefce26aca9816d7.jpg 800w, /media/146278c268c26fc344f0bdd3cbe05e7455bd0e53341e2d88117a0a169cf131ee.jpg 1600w, /media/f91d68aee11f102247b2da00f312ad7be9aa8ab97a81ecbad0ada77a7a910975.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Other details include: a 2-way waterproof zipper, a fit optimized for the bike, but casual enough to wear with Mission Pants, and all the adjustments and cinch cords you could ask for. Wear it on your bike, Ornot.</p>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://alnk.to/90DWUBG\" target=\"_blank\">Fog Eater at Ornot.</a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/ornot-fog-eater\">Ornot Fog Eater: Carl’s Nemesis</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"Paul Kalifatidi","comments":"https://theradavist.com/ornot-fog-eater#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"d3a07dab296522f981ee86b345016cdeee3f90cde3615ab19f754d863337afc0","category":"Cycling"}